---
import LegalLayout from '../layouts/LegalLayout.astro';
---

<LegalLayout title="Passenger Terms">
  <h1>Passenger terms</h1>
  <p class="legal-notice">These terms are pending final legal review.</p>

  <section>
    <h2>Your obligations as a passenger</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Post accurate trip details (flight, cities, spare baggage capacity)</li>
      <li>Inspect every parcel before accepting it</li>
      <li>Never accept an unopened or suspicious parcel</li>
      <li>Understand that customs authorities can hold you responsible for your baggage contents</li>
      <li>Pay the refundable deposit and Khepia commission through the approved flow</li>
      <li>Complete collection confirmation</li>
      <li>Verify recipient identity at delivery</li>
      <li>Upload delivery proof</li>
      <li>Mark delivery through the platform</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Refundable deposit</h2>
    <p>The deposit equals the declared value of the parcel. It is returned after the delivery flow completes successfully. The deposit exists because you temporarily have possession of a parcel belonging to someone else.</p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Earnings</h2>
    <p>Your net carrying earning is the agreed carrying amount minus Khepia's commission. This is released to you after successful delivery confirmation, along with your full deposit return.</p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Training</h2>
    <p>All passengers should complete the <a href="/#training">Passenger Training</a> before accepting their first parcel.</p>
  </section>
</LegalLayout>
